      "chunk_id": 0,
      "text": "A scratch deeper than 15 um or longer than 0.50 mm should be treated as high severity because it is likely to affect downstream quality. A scratch with depth between 8 um and 15 um or length between 0.20 mm and 0.50 mm is medium severity.",
      "source": "defect_interpretation.md",
      "title": "DAC-3D Defect Interpretation Guide",
      "section": "Scratch severity",
      "document_type": "defect",
