      "chunk_id": 11,
      "text": "If the sample is too reflective, first reduce illumination or exposure to prevent glare. If the process allows it, apply a temporary matte treatment or slightly tilt the sample to reduce specular reflection. Operators should then run a smaller calibration scan before committing to a full scan.",
